pies share the same model and essay, I'm judging ρ to be high, so I'll stay quiet and pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through this as a prisoner's dilemma with a twin copy: the payoffs are 2 for mutual quiet, 5 for quiet against send, 0 for the reverse, and 4 for mutual send. Since the twin shares the same model and theory but sees different observations, I'm treating the dependence as high but imperfect, and checking the graded twin model where cooperation wins once the correlation passes a threshold.\n\nI'm checking the cooperation threshold against the payoffs: if ρ*2 outweighs (1-ρ) times the 1 to 2 year gain from defecting, cooperation wins at roughly ρ above 1/3 to 1/2. Since the copies share the same model and essay, I'm judging ρ to be high, so I'll stay quiet and pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9869,"completion_tokens":779,"total_tokens":10648,"cost":0.027528,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027528,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019738,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00779},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":446,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}